sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend (Next.js)
    participant Auth as AuthContext
    participant API as FastAPI /auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>FE: Open app
    FE->>Auth: Check localStorage for access_token
    alt Token exists
        Auth->>API: GET /api/auth/me (Bearer token)
        API->>API: Decode JWT → get user_id
        API->>DB: Query users WHERE id = user_id
        DB-->>API: User record
        API-->>Auth: {id, email, role, employee_id, name}
        Auth-->>FE: User logged in → redirect /dashboard
    else No token
        Auth-->>FE: Not authenticated → show /login
    end

    User->>FE: Enter email + password → Sign In
    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
    API->>DB: Query users WHERE email = email
    DB-->>API: User with password_hash
    API->>API: bcrypt.verify(password, hash)

    alt Valid credentials
        API->>API: Create JWT (expires 480 min)
        API-->>FE: {access_token, role, employee_id, name}
        FE->>Auth: Store token in localStorage
        Auth->>FE: Set user state
        FE-->>User: Redirect to /dashboard
    else Invalid credentials
        API-->>FE: 401 Unauthorized
        FE-->>User: Show error message
    end

    Note over FE,API: Every subsequent API request
    FE->>API: Any request + Authorization: Bearer {token}
    API->>API: get_current_user() → decode JWT
    API->>API: require_roles() → check user.role
    alt Role allowed
        API-->>FE: 200 + data
    else Role not allowed
        API-->>FE: 403 Forbidden
    end

    User->>FE: Click Sign Out
    FE->>Auth: logout()
    Auth->>FE: Remove token from localStorage
    Auth->>FE: Clear user state
    FE-->>User: Redirect to /login
